WEBVTT

00:02.581 --> 00:05.921
<b><i>It's been five days since 
I debuted{commie what are you smoking, he says "debut" and there's nothing wrong with it} as a professional hero.</i></b>

00:06.421 --> 00:08.511
<b><i>There haven't been any serious incidents so far.</i></b>

00:09.551 --> 00:13.931
<b><i>However, Genos is now living with me{staying at my house} for some reason.</i></b>

00:14.931 --> 00:16.931
<b>What are you writing over there?</b>

00:16.931 --> 00:20.231
<b>I'm recording the details of your lessons and training regimen.</b>

00:20.641 --> 00:23.191
<b><i>Crap. He's raising the bar again…</i></b>

00:23.651 --> 00:26.651
<b><i>I can't think of a single thing I can teach the guy.</i></b>

00:26.651 --> 00:29.781
<b><i>I feel {bad, }like I'm scamming him or something.</i></b>

00:29.781 --> 00:30.571
<b><i>Come on, think.</i></b>

00:30.571 --> 00:34.281
<b><i>At least make up some techniques 
or a spiritual theory.{Or just make up some techniques or a spiritual theory.}{split pls hyaku}</i></b>

00:34.281 --> 00:36.201
<b><i>Argh, strength training's all I've got!{"bah" from saitama, lmao}</i></b>

00:36.201 --> 00:37.741
<b><i>But I know that won't satisfy Genos!</i></b>

00:37.741 --> 00:38.911
<b><i>Plus, he{the dude}'s a cyborg!{pls split hyaku}</i></b>

00:38.911 --> 00:39.291
<b>By the way,</b>

00:40.121 --> 00:45.381
<b>at the seminar, they said {if you're a }C-class heroes 
who are inactive for a week{and you have no hero activity for a week,}</b>

00:45.381 --> 00:48.091
<b>{your name }{will be}are removed from the Hero Registry.</b>

00:48.091 --> 00:49.251
<b>Aren't you cutting it close{, Master}?{Will you be all right, Master?}</b>

00:50.131 --> 00:51.921
<b>They said that?!</b>

00:51.921 --> 00:52.341
<b>Yes.</b>

00:52.341 --> 00:55.591
<b>But I was watching TV and 
there wasn't anything going on.</b>

00:55.591 --> 00:59.181
<b>The news only reports major incidents,</b>

00:59.181 --> 01:02.311
<b>like natural disasters, terrorism, and dangerous monsters.</b>

01:02.731 --> 01:06.561
<b>You always fight the most powerful enemies, 
so this is probably new to you,{you probably do not know it}</b>

01:07.021 --> 01:09.821
<b>but C-class heroes primarily 
take care of purse snatchers,</b>

01:09.821 --> 01:12.241
<b>robberies, and random attacks.</b>

01:12.241 --> 01:13.821
<b>With Class C so full of heroes,</b>

01:13.821 --> 01:16.661
<b>they must actively look for cases to resolve in order to stay afloat.</b>

01:16.661 --> 01:19.081
<b>I hear many of them get discouraged 
and change careers.</b>

01:19.411 --> 01:24.331
<b>Like a salesman doing cold calls, 
nothing will come your way without legwork.</b>

01:24.661 --> 01:26.581
<b>This is no time to be reading manga{nice meme commie}!</b>

01:27.171 --> 01:28.081
<b>So we're going?</b>

01:28.081 --> 01:29.211
<b>You stay here!</b>

01:29.211 --> 01:33.341
<b>If I'm with an S-class hero, 
a C-class like me won't get any credit!</b>

01:33.341 --> 01:34.921
<b>But as your {*}apprentice{*disciple}—</b>

01:36.341 --> 01:38.761
<b>Genos, from the beginning,</b>

01:38.761 --> 01:42.721
<b>my intense desire to be a hero was 
what drove me to strength training.</b>

01:42.721 --> 01:44.311
<b>That's how I made it this far.</b>

01:44.981 --> 01:50.481
<b>{For you, }Perhaps things will change for you too 
if you set higher goals for yourself{aim higher} as a hero.</b>

01:51.521 --> 01:52.981
<b>Frankly speaking, you're a cyborg,</b>

01:53.481 --> 01:55.491
<b>so there's no point in{use} training your body{won't do}.</b>

01:55.491 --> 01:58.621
<b>Instead, a change in mindset 
may lead you to greater strength.</b>

02:00.491 --> 02:03.661
<b><i>Damn, I'm just making all this crap up…</i></b>

02:05.041 --> 02:07.001
<b>So… in other words,</b>

