05:33.711 --> 05:37.081
<b>I told you, I'm busy.</b>

05:38.291 --> 05:40.921
<b>And I'm pissed off, so anyone in my way…</b>

05:43.381 --> 05:44.431
<b>gets punched.{a knuckle sandwich.}{cps}</b>

05:46.551 --> 05:47.181
<b>That's him!</b>

05:47.761 --> 05:48.931
<b>He's {very, }very dangerous.{this line is making me question keyframe-based timing altogether}{how did the text of this line make it through 5+ edit passes untouched}</b>

05:49.261 --> 05:51.181
<b>Please stop him.</b>

05:51.181 --> 05:52.481
<b>It's you{You're the offender}, eh?!</b>

05:52.481 --> 05:57.771
<b>Well, your hero, Tank-Top Tiger, is here now!</b>

05:59.071 --> 06:00.531
<b><i>Hero?</i></b>

06:01.651 --> 06:04.531
<b>Sonic, they think you're some sort of criminal.</b>

06:05.031 --> 06:07.621
<b>Maybe getting tossed in a cell 
will cool off your hot—</b>

06:08.491 --> 06:10.281
<b>She means you, cueball.</b>

06:11.331 --> 06:12.541
<b>Huh?</b>

06:12.541 --> 06:17.671
<b>He's been running around town with this scary look on his face since yesterday!</b>

06:17.671 --> 06:19.291
<b>But I'm a hero too!</b>

06:19.291 --> 06:22.341
