07:29.451 --> 07:33.741
<b>create a situation where you have no choice 
but to fight me, Saitama the Hero!</b>

07:35.291 --> 07:36.581
<b>Hail of Carnage!</b>

07:42.711 --> 07:43.541
<b>Huh?</b>

07:47.381 --> 07:48.591
<b>Hey! Cut it out!</b>

07:48.591 --> 07:51.301
<b>Saitama, come stop me!</b>

07:51.841 --> 07:53.181
<b>Aren't you a hero?!</b>

07:53.181 --> 07:54.971
<b>I'm gonna kill 'em all!</b>

08:01.481 --> 08:02.521
<b>Dammit.</b>

08:03.021 --> 08:05.151
<b>Can't everyone just let me do my job?</b>

08:05.781 --> 08:08.191
<b>I don't have time for this!</b>

08:09.451 --> 08:11.781
<b>I gotta find a bad guy to take down.</b>

08:16.041 --> 08:17.081
<b><i>A bad guy?</i></b>

08:18.331 --> 08:20.581
<b>If you're not coming, I'll come to you!</b>

08:20.921 --> 08:21.831
<b>I'm right here.</b>

08:31.511 --> 08:33.971
<b>I wonder if this'll count as work?{this is questionable intonation to my american ears}</b>

08:35.931 --> 08:39.641
<b>The man apprehended in City Z by the C-class hero</b>

08:39.641 --> 08:43.901
<b>is suspected of being involved in several heinous crimes, including assassination.</b>

08:45.771 --> 08:47.191
<b>City Z…</b>

08:49.651 --> 08:51.991
<b>What's the status of the investigation I requested?</b>

08:52.281 --> 08:54.031
<b>The one for the ghost town?</b>

08:54.031 --> 08:54.661
<b>Yes.</b>

08:54.661 --> 08:55.991
<b>Let's see…</b>

08:57.241 --> 08:59.751
<b>We've submitted an official request.</b>

09:01.291 --> 09:04.581
<b>Well now, doesn't that sound interesting?</b>

09:04.581 --> 09:05.961
<b>Want me to go?</b>

09:05.961 --> 09:07.001
<b>T-Tatsumaki?</b>

09:07.671 --> 09:08.961
<b>Where'd you come from?</b>

09:08.961 --> 09:11.051
<b>Why? Aren't I allowed in here?</b>

09:11.051 --> 09:11.921
<b>Of course.</b>

09:11.921 --> 09:15.141
<b>But the City Z investigation is just a formality.</b>

09:15.141 --> 09:16.011
<b>What?</b>

09:17.301 --> 09:19.521
<b>You think I'm not good enough?</b>

09:23.271 --> 09:24.021
<b>Not at all.</b>

09:24.481 --> 09:28.401
<b>The Association decided that 
this didn't concern Class S.</b>

09:28.401 --> 09:30.531
<b>Yes, precisely.</b>

09:35.161 --> 09:38.621
<b>You'd better tell me if you find 
anything that looks like it can fight.</b>

09:42.291 --> 09:44.621
<b>It'd be so much faster if I just went myself.</b>

09:45.541 --> 09:46.961
<b>You're such an idiot.</b>

