<b>CITY A</b>

10:14.361 --> 10:18.071
<b>HERO ASSOCIATION HQ</b>

10:16.321 --> 10:19.371
<b>Reports have come in from 
each location under investigation.</b>

10:22.031 --> 10:25.081
<b>First is Watchdog Man, Class S, 
investigating City Q.</b>

10:25.081 --> 10:26.161
<b>"Nothing unusual."</b>

10:26.161 --> 10:27.411
<b>Nothing unusual?</b>

10:27.411 --> 10:28.121
<b>That's right.</b>

10:28.121 --> 10:29.751
<b>That's hard to believe.</b>

10:29.751 --> 10:36.011
<b>We all know City Q is a hot spot{zone} with more 
casualties and monsters than any other area.</b>

10:36.011 --> 10:42.891
<b>Knowing him, I'm sure he's implying that he'll 
be able to take care of anything that happens.{"Whatever occurs, I'll be able to take care of it."}</b>

10:43.431 --> 10:46.481
<b>Though he has focused his efforts on City Q,</b>

10:46.481 --> 10:49.771
<b>his monster elimination track record is top-notch.</b>

10:49.771 --> 10:52.231
<b>S-class heroes don't pay much attention to detail{s}.</b>

10:52.231 --> 10:54.651
<b>They're not cut out for writing reports.</b>

10:54.651 --> 10:56.991
<b>Next, City W.</b>

10:56.991 --> 10:58.861
<b>A-class hero Heavy Kong reports:</b>

10:58.861 --> 10:59.661
<b>"Nothing unusual."</b>

11:00.571 --> 11:04.031
<b>For City H, reports from Mushroom, Class B, and Horsebone, Class C:</b>

11:04.031 --> 11:04.661
<b>"Nothing unusual."</b>

11:05.241 --> 11:08.081
<b>City D, Lightning Genji, Class A, reports:</b>

11:08.081 --> 11:13.591
<b>"Aside from slow restoration after the devastation caused by the gigantic creature, nothing unusual."</b>

11:13.591 --> 11:17.011
<b>Cities B and{ City} D both sustained extensive damage.</b>

11:17.011 --> 11:19.551
<b>The Association took a lot of heat for that.</b>

11:19.551 --> 11:22.181
<b>To prevent similar disasters in the future,</b>

11:22.181 --> 11:26.311
<b>we must detect any covert activity 
that could threaten the community.</b>

11:26.811 --> 11:30.641
<b>Well, this investigation was 
requested for that express purpose.</b>

11:30.641 --> 11:33.561
<b>But early detection of monsters is proving difficult.</b>

11:34.441 --> 11:37.571
<b>From City F, Snakebite{"Biting Snake Fist"}{it's the more literal translation but it's more like an epithet than a hero name} Snek, Class A:</b>

11:38.241 --> 11:44.071
<b>"Hammerhead, former leader of the Paradiser terrorist group, has been spotted in a suit and tie.</b>

11:44.071 --> 11:45.701
<b>Further investigation is being conducted."</b>

11:46.081 --> 11:47.291
<b>No other reports.</b>

11:47.291 --> 11:48.701
<b>What of City Z?</b>

11:49.211 --> 11:54.171
<b>I hear rumblings of a potential disaster 
brewing in the abandoned district there.</b>

11:54.171 --> 11:56.211
<b>No reports available.</b>

11:56.631 --> 12:03.341
<b>However, two highly capable A-class heroes have been sent to the area to investigate.</b>

12:05.391 --> 12:07.221
<b>Here we are in City Z.</b>

12:08.471 --> 12:11.731
<b>CLASS A, RANK 33 
SPRING MUSTACHIO</b>

12:08.471 --> 12:11.731
<b>CLASS A, RANK 33 
SPRING MUSTACHIO</b>

12:08.851 --> 12:11.731
<b>Shall we begin our little inquiry?</b>

12:11.931 --> 12:15.561
<b>CLASS A, RANK 29 
GOLDEN BALL</b>

12:11.931 --> 12:15.561
<b>CLASS A, RANK 29 
GOLDEN BALL</b>

12:12.391 --> 12:15.191
<b>Yeah, let's get on with it.</b>

12:20.651 --> 12:23.071
<b>City Z is quite expansive,</b>

12:23.071 --> 12:27.741
<b>but further ahead lies the uninhabited district we were told about.</b>

12:27.741 --> 12:32.871
<b>Compared with other areas, City Z has an 
abnormally high rate of monster-related incidents.{BEWARE OF MONSTERS!! }</b>

