<b>{=96}m -130.5 -69 l 129 -69 129 73.5 -130.5 73.5</b>

12:28.621 --> 12:32.871
<b>{=95}BEWARE OF
 MONSTERS!!</b>

12:33.831 --> 12:37.501
<b>The frequency has been gradually increasing over the past decade{10 years},</b>

12:37.501 --> 12:40.631
<b>while the last few years have seen more and more 
highly advanced monsters appearing.{tlc: highly advanced? highly evolved? or just extremely powerful?}</b>

12:41.341 --> 12:44.761
<b>The residents have all fled for the city center.</b>

12:44.761 --> 12:46.181
<b>I know all that.{way to lampshade that exposition}</b>

12:46.181 --> 12:51.061
<b>The place is a real ghost town, 
just with utilities still working, yeah?</b>

12:51.061 --> 12:53.311
<b>On the lookout for a cheap house?</b>

12:53.311 --> 12:54.141
<b>Come off it.</b>

12:55.021 --> 12:57.861
<b>People say something real nasty's living 'round here.</b>

12:57.861 --> 12:59.941
<b>Even you must've heard 'bout it.</b>

12:59.941 --> 13:01.401
<b>But of course.</b>

13:01.401 --> 13:05.661
<b>I assume that's why <i>we</i> were 
assigned this investigation.</b>

13:06.201 --> 13:10.701
<b>Once we hit the abandoned district, we better be ready to fight.</b>

13:10.701 --> 13:14.621
<b>Indeed, we mustn't let our guard down.</b>

13:16.001 --> 13:19.421
<b>But why here? Why the increase in monsters?</b>

13:19.421 --> 13:21.591
<b>That's the mystery.</b>

13:21.591 --> 13:25.511
<b>Many theories have been proposed{advanced}, 
but my own is this:</b>

13:25.511 --> 13:29.101
<b>A colony of monsters here is naturally breeding{reproducing}{producing more of them}.{tlc: is this what this is supposed to mean}{idk dude i'm not the tlc}</b>

13:29.101 --> 13:32.061
<b>Or perhaps a queen exists, 
spawning{birthing} more of her kind.</b>

13:35.441 --> 13:38.861
<b>Of course, I have no proof yet,</b>

13:38.861 --> 13:41.571
<b>but there is something to this ghost town.</b>

13:42.111 --> 13:44.031
<b>Or rather, something <i>in</i> it.</b>

13:44.651 --> 13:46.911
<b>There's no denying that.{Of that you can be sure.}</b>

13:48.571 --> 13:50.531
<b>The proximity alarm?</b>

13:50.831 --> 13:52.751
<b>If we can hunt down this monster,</b>

13:52.751 --> 13:55.371
<b>we'll go straight to the top of the rankings.</b>

13:55.371 --> 13:56.711
<b>That's true.</b>

13:56.711 --> 13:59.131
<b>We can't let Amai Mask remain first for—</b>

13:59.881 --> 14:00.751
<b><i>Behind us{An enemy}?!{– Something's there?! – Something's there?!}</i></b>

14:01.051 --> 14:02.461
<b>Was that a monster?</b>

14:02.461 --> 14:04.091
<b>No way to be sure.</b>

14:04.421 --> 14:07.971
<b>But it's hard to imagine a human still living in these conditions.</b>

14:08.761 --> 14:10.141
<b>Let's pursue it!</b>

14:13.521 --> 14:15.521
<b>Seems they aren't after us.</b>

14:18.151 --> 14:20.401
<b>Could this be{Is this} the place I heard about?</b>

14:20.861 --> 14:23.571
<b>Sure don't seem like it…{i can't tell whether this is in a dialect/accent, but viz subs, fansubs, and the dub all seem to be in agreement so I'm leaving it}</b>

14:23.571 --> 14:26.651
<b>Aw man, I came all this way.</b>

14:26.651 --> 14:27.911
<b>Isn't anyone around?</b>

14:30.951 --> 14:32.201
<b>A monster.</b>

14:32.201 --> 14:33.491
<b>It popped up out of nowhere.</b>

14:34.201 --> 14:36.541
<b>Golden Ball, are you ready?</b>

14:36.541 --> 14:37.661
<b>Hell yeah!</b>

14:37.661 --> 14:39.421
<b>Victory to the swift!</b>

14:39.711 --> 14:40.921
<b>Hey, people!</b>

14:41.341 --> 14:45.961
<b>My golden shape-memory bullets{I can blast through a 20mm steel plate} can blast through a 20mm steel plate{with one of my shape-memory golden bullets}!</b>

14:46.511 --> 14:47.761
<b>Eat this!</b>

14:56.271 --> 14:57.851
<b><i>They{It} swatted{flicked} it away like a fly{like it was nothing}!</i></b>

15:10.911 --> 15:11.661
<b>Golden!</b>

15:42.601 --> 15:43.981
<b>Wow!</b>

15:54.321 --> 15:55.241
<b>Tomboy…</b>

15:57.371 --> 15:58.121
<b>Thrust!</b>

16:01.371 --> 16:04.081
<b><i>I-It slipped past my Tomboy?!</i></b>

16:10.841 --> 16:12.221
<b>Not bad.</b>

16:12.841 --> 16:14.301
<b><i>Those tentacles…</i></b>

16:14.301 --> 16:16.471
<b><i>They must be as tough as steel.</i></b>

16:16.971 --> 16:21.731
<b><i>A monster that can use its infinite {number of }tentacles like steel whips…</i></b>

16:22.391 --> 16:23.521
<b><i>Such power!</i></b>

16:27.941 --> 16:30.401
<b><i>I must{ugh.} call in reinforcements from the Association.</i></b>

16:31.451 --> 16:36.331
<b>May I ask if you were born in this neighborhood?</b>

16:37.701 --> 16:39.701
<b>Nah, I'm from out of town.</b>

16:40.121 --> 16:44.791
<b>I heard a bunch of crazy strong monsters were all getting together here.{spoiler-exposed anime only here; this is hella foreshadowing isn't it}</b>

16:44.791 --> 16:49.001
<b>Looks like it was just a rumor though.</b>

16:49.001 --> 16:50.341
<b>But now,</b>

16:52.221 --> 16:57.551
<b>I feel like it'd be kinda fun to stick around 
and make the rumor true.</b>

16:57.931 --> 16:59.601
<b>The Ghost Town Monster…</b>

17:00.271 --> 17:02.681
<b>It's got a nice ring to it!</b>

17:03.641 --> 17:07.691
<b>We have a backup request from the heroes dispatched to City Z.</b>

17:07.691 --> 17:10.981
<b>Class A rank 29, Golden Ball, has been knocked out.</b>

17:10.981 --> 17:13.951
<b>Class A rank 33, Spring Mustachio, is in trouble.</b>

17:13.951 --> 17:15.611
<b>They're in the abandoned city.</b>

17:15.611 --> 17:18.581
<b>Call in all nearby heroes for immediate assistance!</b>

17:18.581 --> 17:19.581
<b>Class A and above!</b>

17:20.451 --> 17:22.661
<b>You see the monster alert for City Z?</b>

17:22.661 --> 17:25.291
